netboot.xyz menus
-----------------
Copyright netboot.xyz contributors - https://github.com/netbootxyz/netboot.xyz
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

ipxe/        Rendered menus as served by https://boot.netboot.xyz/ on
             2026-11-27, unmodified.
standalone/  Modified versions of ipxe/*.ipxe. Changes (by GlitchLinux):
             - added a standalone bootstrap header (arch detection, DHCP
               retry loop, ntp, ${space}/${cls})
             - inlined the boot.cfg variables each menu uses
             - set ${menu} as the parent menu would
             - redirected exit to a local exit menu
             - added stub labels for goto targets missing upstream
             - added the "Carbon" colour theme
             Each modified file carries a header describing this.

Bundled third-party binaries
----------------------------
iso/, efi/, krn/, refind/ contain compiled iPXE:
  iPXE - https://ipxe.org - GPL-2.0-or-later / UBDL
  Built from unmodified source https://github.com/ipxe/ipxe commit 21f9cda
  (2026-11-25) with build config standalone/ipxe-config/general.h and the
  embedded script standalone/<name>.ipxe (EMBED=). Build script:
  standalone/build-iso.sh.

iso/ contains SYSLINUX/ISOLINUX boot files (isolinux.bin, ldlinux.c32,
isohdpfx.bin) - https://wiki.syslinux.org - GPL-2.0, from the Debian
syslinux/isolinux packages.

refind/ipxe-efi.img contains the rEFInd boot manager (EFI/BOOT/bootx64.efi) -
https://www.rodsbooks.com/refind/ - GPL-3.0-or-later.
